      "widgets_values": [
        "Seedream 5.0 flash splits the poster into separate layers, such as the title, the lanterns, and the date. **Join Image with Alpha** gives each layer its transparency, and the layers are saved as PNG files, each at its place on a canvas the size of the poster. Each layer is billed as one image."
      ],
      "title": "Note"
